            "sid": "NEH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba ilyo intungulushi sha bantu shaile ikala mu Yerusalemu, elyo abantu bonse bacitile ukubapendwilafye pakuti basale umo mu lupwa pa bali ikumi uwakwikala mu musumba wa Yerusalemu, icifulo camushilo. Lelo bonse abashala ukulingana ne mpendwa ya pabula bali nokutwalilila ukwikala mu misumba yabo iyo balefwaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu nabo batashishe nganshi aba bonse abaume abaile ikala mu musumba wa Yerusalemu mukuitemenwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
